    -> Aggregate using temporary table
        -> Gather: 4 workers, parallel scan on t0  (cost=0.375 rows=4)
            -> Table scan on <temporary>
                -> Aggregate using temporary table
                    -> Parallel table scan on t0  (cost=0.375 rows=1.25)

