        -> Aggregate: sum(`<temporary>`.`SUM(ROUND(t1.a, 2))`), sum(`<temporary>`.`sum((round(t1.a,2) - round(ifnull(t1.b,0),2)))`)  (cost=0.6 rows=1)
            -> Parallel table scan on t1  (cost=0.425 rows=1.75)

